# Expected decoding of harrovf.hex, written by hand from MTP 1.1, 3.2.2; 7.9 here (before a count is used) (not produced
# by the library or by simdev.c). Format: README.md.

parser = HandleArray
result = MTPE_PROTOCOL reason=MTPR_COUNT (the fit is checked before the cap: CQ39); never an allocation for the count
count = 40000001h (its product with 4 is 100000004h, past 2^32; 8 bytes follow)
end
